            "label": "Hero",
            "name": "widget_1749579245790",
            "params": {
             "banner_image_group": {
              "alt": "Frame 427321061-1",
              "height": 91,
              "loading": "lazy",
              "max_height": 91,
              "max_width": 957,
              "size_type": "auto",
              "src": "https://5767502.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5767502/Frame%20427321061-1.png",
              "width": 957
             },
             "button": {
              "button_1": {
               "link": "https://www.flieber.com/book-a-demo",
               "text_field": "Book a Demo"
              },
              "button_2": {
               "link": "https://www.flieber.com/free-trial"
              }
             },
             "content": "<p>Flieber is an AI-powered demand planning and forecasting platform made for multichannel commerce. It connects directly to tools like Amazon, Shopify, and your WMS, delivering fast, accurate forecasts without long onboarding or heavy ERP-style setup.</p>\n<p>NetSuite is a legacy ERP built to track the past, not plan the future. Its forecasting is rigid and accounting-driven, lacking the speed, intelligence, and usability operators need to make smart decisions across fast-moving channels.</p>",
             "css_class": "dnd-module",
             "heading": "<span>Flieber</span> vs. Netsuite",
