       {
        "0": {
         "cells": [],
         "cssClass": "",
         "cssId": "",
         "cssStyle": "",
         "label": "Two-Col-Content-Img",
         "name": "widget_1749723887648",
         "params": {
          "background_color": "#CCD9DB",
          "button": {
           "link": ""
          },
          "content": "<p>Flieber is made for operators who need to act quickly and confidently about future inventory decisions. Its forecasting tools are dynamic, scenario-ready, and designed to drive real planning across sales channels.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>NetSuite was designed around accounting processes and control, not for operators making real-time decisions. Its forecasting tools reflect that DNA, offering static projections that lack the flexibility needed for fast, forward-looking commerce demand planning.</p>",
          "content_width": "435px",
          "css_class": "dnd-module",
          "heading": "Empowering forward-thinking operators, not limiting them to the past",
          "image_field": {
           "alt": "forecast-img-1",
           "height": 439,
           "loading": "lazy",
           "max_height": 439,
           "max_width": 450,
           "size_type": "exact",
           "src": "https://5767502.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5767502/forecast-img-1.png",
           "width": 450
          },
          "module_id": 191281957771,
          "schema_version": 2,
          "subheading": ""
         },
         "rowMetaData": [],
         "rows": [],
         "type": "custom_widget",
         "w": 12,
         "x": 0
        }
       },
       {
        "0": {
         "cells": [],
         "cssClass": "",
         "cssId": "",
         "cssStyle": "",
         "label": "Two-Col-Content-Img",
         "name": "widget_1749706917812",
         "params": {
          "background_color": "#186DFF",
          "button": {
           "link": ""
          },
          "content": "<p>Flieber supports Amazon, Shopify, Walmart, wholesale, and more, using forecasting logic tailored to how modern commerce actually works.</p>\n<p>NetSuite\u2019s forecasting assumes a traditional ERP module, and then forces brands to pay up for heavy custom workarounds just to manage bundles, channels, or fast-moving inventory.</p>",
          "content_width": "400px",
          "css_class": "dnd-module",
          "heading": "Designed for multichannel brands, not ERP templates",
          "image_field": {
           "alt": "multichannel-1",
           "height": 411,
           "loading": "lazy",
           "max_height": 411,
           "max_width": 518,
           "size_type": "auto_custom_max",
           "src": "https://5767502.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5767502/multichannel-1.svg",
           "width": 518
          },
          "layout": "image-left",
          "main_background_color": "#CCD9DB",
          "module_id": 191281957771,
          "schema_version": 2,
          "subheading": "",
          "text_color": "#FFF"
         },
         "rowMetaData": [],
         "rows": [],
         "type": "custom_widget",
         "w": 12,
         "x": 0
        }
