       {
        "0": {
         "cells": [],
         "cssClass": "",
         "cssId": "",
         "cssStyle": "",
         "label": "Two-Col-Content-Img",
         "name": "widget_1749724825893",
         "params": {
          "background_color": "#F0F5F6",
          "button": {
           "text_field": "Book a Demo"
          },
          "content": "<p>Flieber delivers accurate AI-powered forecasts through a clean, intuitive UI made for operators. It\u2019s up and running in hours, with no consultants required.</p>\n<p>NetSuite requires months of setup, costly implementation, just to start. You\u2019ll also need ongoing third-party ERP support, which creates delays, and adds complexities that slow operators down.</p>",
          "content_width": "415px",
          "css_class": "dnd-module",
          "heading": "Fast to launch, easy to use, and more intelligent",
          "image_field": {
           "alt": "easy-to-use",
           "height": 1038,
           "loading": "lazy",
